# core.autocrlf is on, and this repo had no .gitattributes at all — the
# committed hash index survived its first round trip only because git's
# NUL-byte heuristic happened to guess binary. Pin it explicitly so a
# rebuilt index can't be corrupted by line-ending translation.
*.lfidx binary

